Use ```{note} to create a note in MyST.

Code directives with languages:

<beginfold id='8'>```{code-block} python</beginfold id='8'>
def fenced<beginfold id='10'>(</beginfold id='10'><endfold id='10'>)</endfold id='10'>:
    pass
