Colon directives with languages:

<beginfold id='11'>:::python</beginfold id='11'>
def colon_directive<beginfold id='10'>(</beginfold id='10'><endfold id='10'>)</endfold id='10'>:
    pass
<endfold id='11'>:::</endfold id='11'>

<beginfold id='9'>:::{code-block} bash</beginfold id='9'>
